{"availability":"available","full":"mnove/json-view-cn","name":"json-view-cn","description":"Fully-customizable, collapsible, syntax-highlighted JSON tree viewer. Ready to be copy-pasted.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":9,"forks":1,"created":"2026-05-09T13:31:46Z","updated":"2026-09-26T14:55:52Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://json-view-cn.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://json-view-cn.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:33.296Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:33.296Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:33.296Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T17:54:33.296Z","stars":9,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A fully-customizable, collapsible, syntax-highlighted JSON tree viewer component for React. Built with shadcn/ui, Base UI, and Tailwind CSS v4. Ready to be copy-pasted into your project."],"features":["Collapsible nodes — Click any object or array row to expand/collapse. Collapsed nodes show their item/key count; empty objects and arrays render inline.","Syntax highlighting — Color-coded keys, strings, numbers, booleans, and null values. Fully customizable via the theme prop.","Copy on hover — A copy button appears next to each line on hover or keyboard focus. Objects and arrays are copied as formatted JSON, strings as their raw text.","Indent guide lines — Vertical lines connecting nested levels, with hover highlight. Togglable.","String truncation — Long strings are truncated with a tooltip preview. Click to expand inline, click again to collapse."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mnove/json-view-cn/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6b8deca86d59b922afbcabd3405275682cc400e9826ebc2861d4dc994c54abb7","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:33.427Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:33.427Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A fully-customizable, collapsible, syntax-highlighted JSON tree viewer component for Rea